WEBVTT

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:55.420
Still quite lacking in your fishing techniques, my lord?

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:00.040
I'll catch the next one.

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:31.910
Boy, not a care in the world.

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:36.430
Is there something on my face?

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.390
Sorry!

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:46.460
You look so serene, so...

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.480
Yeah, especially after all those wars.

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:03.890
Hey Touka, did you know?

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:10.500
There is a spirit residing in this river.

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:17.540
There is a spirit...?

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:26.120
Many people have reported seeing the outline of an enormous fish.

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.000
My goodness...

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.610
What would you do if it shows up?

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:47.240
Evenkuruga warriors never fail in a fight!

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:49.700
Even if the opponent is a fish!

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.300
That's good to hear, Touka.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.920
Just leave it to me!

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:57.350
I will capture it for sure!

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:04.550
You sure are hard to find, my lord.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:11.600
With a mountain of post-war tasks at hand, what are you doing here?

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:14.060
Uh, you see...

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.230
I should head back too, then!

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.240
Touka.

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.560
You can just stay.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.320
B-but...

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:27.580
Just stay.  That's an order.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.950
Catch that spirit for us.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:37.860
I'll leave Aruruu to you too.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.930
An order...

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.020
An order?!

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:08.940
The days pile ever onward, hiding the radiance within

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:19.670
Believing in the inevitable, inside the cradle of magma

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:39.320
Where are you battling?  What have you earned?

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:45.820
Have you noticed my gaze, here by your side

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:53.670
Longing, waiting, this feeling grows ever strong

00:04:53.870 --> 00:05:02.090
Yearning, straying, things always seem to go wrong

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:10.980
Even if the road ahead has been decided by others

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:18.570
Only for your sake, I will go on without resistance

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:25.880
The days pile ever onward, hiding the radiance within

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:35.180
Believing in the inevitable, born in profound darkness

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:43.170
Inside the cradle of magma

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:57.310
<b>Vol 3. Sheathing Sound of the Deep Mountains</b>

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:57.690
Go!  Go!

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.580
That must be the spirit of the river!

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.460
Aruruu!

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:49.150
Aruruu!

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.160
W-wait...!

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:12.100
Aruruu!

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:18.240
Aruruu!

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:36.450
Aruruu!

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:40.140
Thank goodness you are safe!

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:42.700
Let's hurry back to the castle.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.640
Aruruu!

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:49.550
We don't know this place...  Too dangerous at night...

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.400
B-but...

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.400
Nap time...

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.820
Aruruu...

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:09.480
So cute...

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:19.290
Oh no, she will catch a cold.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:10.210
I'll return you home safely, Aruruu, you have my word.

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.190
I vow upon this sword-

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.150
Now then, everyone...

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:00.150
Let's eat!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.050
Ah.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.720
Did the flavor change?

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.150
It's a bit heavier than before.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:29.310
The guys do enjoy a heavier taste.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.310
Another bowl please!

00:11:34.740 --> 00:11:37.730
You sure have a big appetite in the morning.

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.820
I'm envious of you.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:43.800
May I have another serving too?

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.830
Sure, there's still plenty more!

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:51.830
By the way...

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:55.120
Are we missing someone...?

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:04.340
Um...

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.850
Dorii.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:06.850
It's Guraa.

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:11.640
S-sorry...  Where did Dorii go?

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:14.350
Oboro isn't around either...

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:21.110
The young lord and Dorii...

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:32.120
Dorii and Oboro are out searching for Aruruu and Touka.

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:35.010
I wasn't aware they were missing.

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:40.130
You ordered Touka to catch the spirit of the river, have you already forgotten?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.630
She took it seriously?

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:50.570
Here, young lord.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.570
Geez, what's wrong with me...

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:38.100
Please wait just a bit longer.  I'll have breakfast ready right away.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:49.570
Um...  Aruruu...

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:52.620
What are you eating?

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:57.370
Many thanks!

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.900
It's yummy.

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:28.390
According to the secret teaching of Evenkuruga,

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:34.930
A mushroom that splits vertically possesses no poison.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.580
Okay.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.920
Seems like these are all edible.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:52.580
Here, help yourself to some too.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:56.830
Now then, let's eat.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:44.480
Chew on this.  You'll feel better.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.600
Many thanks.

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:53.840
Is she alright?

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:57.340
A poisoned mushroom!

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:05.500
Hey guys, apparently there's a monster in the mountains near Tusukuru.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:08.920
A monster?

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:11.760
It's on Tusu-Today.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:20.010
"A monster the size of a small mountain appeared and stared this way!"

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:25.490
Hah, just from Tusu-Today?

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:30.280
You may want to take it with a grain of salt.

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:34.780
But it even says where the monster was spotted, see?

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:38.590
And by many people too.

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:57.590
Still lively even on land, huh?

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:04.710
Is something the matter?

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:10.030
Let's go home.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.140
Please wait!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.750
Almost forgot about you.

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:28.320
Please wait, Aruruu!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:35.020
They both left...

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:38.000
She's with Aruruu, so they'll be fine.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.060
Besides...

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:40.340
Besides?

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:44.270
I want to enjoy this a bit longer.

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:48.850
Geez, my young lord.

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:21.490
Dead end.

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:24.880
Allow me to take care of this.

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:26.770
Just a moment please!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.840
We can go straight across using this.

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:03.600
M-many thanks!

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:11.620
Alright, over there!

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.580
Right here!

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:35.630
Geez, what's wrong with me?!

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:45.690
Let's go.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.180
Many thanks.

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.260
Aruruu.

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:32.020
You are quite versed in living outdoors.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:39.030
Granny and sis taught me.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:46.870
You are from Yamayura Village, right?

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:51.000
Sis is more amazing.  She knows lots more.

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.990
I'm sure...

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:07.340
I've turned out to be the one that needs looking after...

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:13.190
Haven't I?

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.510
Let's go home.

00:21:32.510 --> 00:21:34.830
Everyone's waiting.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:39.280
'Kay.

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:46.810
Young lord, we should head back soon...

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:49.340
The folks back home must be worried.

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:53.910
Just a bit longer.  The fun is just-

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:56.070
An earthquake?

00:22:27.480 --> 00:22:28.880
This will have to do.

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:42.650
Give my young lord back!

00:22:53.070 --> 00:22:54.600
Young lord!

00:22:57.150 --> 00:22:58.950
Oboro!

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:03.880
You stink!

00:23:08.930 --> 00:23:12.890
Rest assured!  A foe of this caliber is a piece of cake!

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:17.640
So you must be the real spirit.

00:23:24.550 --> 00:23:25.150
Here I come!

00:23:41.150 --> 00:23:41.970
Touka!

00:23:41.970 --> 00:23:42.790
Watch out!

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:56.550
Mukkuru!

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:04.600
Mukkuru!

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:12.450
Such a heinous spirit isn't worthy of being offered to the lord.

00:24:12.980 --> 00:24:15.950
Touka of Evenkuruga cometh!

00:24:19.050 --> 00:24:20.530
One!

00:24:23.370 --> 00:24:24.420
Two!

00:24:27.440 --> 00:24:27.960
Three!

00:24:29.630 --> 00:24:30.210
Four strikes!

00:24:39.250 --> 00:24:40.730
Touka!

00:24:49.960 --> 00:24:51.750
It left...

00:24:51.750 --> 00:24:53.440
Yup.

00:24:53.440 --> 00:24:55.340
We should head back too.

00:25:10.420 --> 00:25:12.810
Aruruu!

00:25:14.110 --> 00:25:15.500
Sis!

00:25:21.490 --> 00:25:23.080
Welcome home, Aruruu!

00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:24.520
Welcome home.

00:25:26.140 --> 00:25:29.020
My deepest apology for the delay, my lord.

00:25:29.860 --> 00:25:32.040
Good job, no less.

00:25:32.040 --> 00:25:34.640
As long as you are both back safely.

00:25:37.590 --> 00:25:40.530
I'm not worthy of your kind words.

00:25:42.500 --> 00:25:44.910
Aruruu, are you alright?

00:25:44.910 --> 00:25:47.950
Touka was amazing.

00:25:47.950 --> 00:25:49.790
Was she?

00:25:50.290 --> 00:25:53.300
Thank you, Touka.

00:25:53.300 --> 00:25:54.800
No, I...

00:25:54.800 --> 00:25:57.490
I didn't do anything...

00:25:58.190 --> 00:25:59.800
That aside...

00:26:01.500 --> 00:26:04.400
Just what on earth happened to Oboro?

00:26:04.400 --> 00:26:08.040
Young lord, you stink...

00:26:09.210 --> 00:26:11.430
O-oh yeah!

00:26:11.430 --> 00:26:16.570
My lord, I caught a fish that could very possibly be the spirit of the river!

00:26:18.130 --> 00:26:20.280
There really was one...?

00:26:20.280 --> 00:26:25.790
It's lively even on land, as expected from a spirit.

00:26:42.500 --> 00:26:44.020
Again?!

00:26:44.020 --> 00:26:45.240
Oh no!

00:26:45.240 --> 00:26:47.160
Young lord!

00:26:47.160 --> 00:26:52.860
I-I'm so sorry!  Geez, what's wrong with me?!

00:27:00.900 --> 00:27:09.570
I once drew to my heart's content, a dream that never fades

00:27:09.810 --> 00:27:21.070
A dream of the hopes for the future, a dream I couldn't reach in my childhood days

00:27:27.180 --> 00:27:35.190
Locked up in my heart, completely forgotten

00:27:35.420 --> 00:27:44.360
That dream I sketched endlessly once upon a time

00:27:44.690 --> 00:27:59.450
Regretting, lamenting, yet I cannot get it back

00:28:00.380 --> 00:28:08.990
I dreamt of flying high in the skies, freely like the birds

00:28:09.210 --> 00:28:17.300
Spread my wings wide, as if embracing the whole world

00:28:17.470 --> 00:28:25.980
This wind caressing my cheek, although cold to the touch

00:28:26.190 --> 00:28:39.460
Has quietly become pleasant in this unexplainable anxiety
